flowchart TD
 A[No turn; duration zero; GOOD] -->|RMS above 0.02| B[Start turn; refresh last qualifying sound]
 B --> C[Active turn]
 C -->|More qualifying sound| D[Refresh last sound; retain start]
 D --> C
 C -->|Quiet at most 2500 ms| E[Retain start; elapsed time continues]
 E --> C
 C -->|Quiet more than 2500 ms| A
 C --> F{Elapsed time}
 F -->|At most 25 seconds| G[GOOD]
 F -->|Above 25 through 35 seconds| H[LAND IT]
 F -->|Above 35 seconds| I[STOP]
 J[Intended speaker, other speaker or loud noise] -->|Same volume test| B
